WEBVTT

01:32.050 --> 01:34.140
It's almost Christmas...

01:35.030 --> 01:43.020
Come to think of it, I've never given Kanata-kun a present as the opportunity always passes me by.

01:43.020 --> 01:47.160
And that's why I'll definitely give him a wonderful present this year.

01:48.380 --> 01:51.360
I wonder what I should give him...

01:56.720 --> 02:02.600
No way... for me<i> to be unable to think of a </i>single<i> thing that would make Kanata-kun happy...</i>

02:02.600 --> 02:06.390
That's it! I've thought of just the thing!

02:08.400 --> 02:10.060
Kanata-kun!

02:12.360 --> 02:16.570
Kanata-kun, I've knitted you a sweater with a design of Miyu-chan.

02:17.320 --> 02:20.740
Aw, how cute.

02:20.740 --> 02:25.700
I also made a matching tuque, gloves, and even a doll.

02:25.700 --> 02:28.940
Well? Does it suit me?

02:28.940 --> 02:31.630
Yes, yes, yes, yes!

02:31.630 --> 02:35.380
Miyu-chan, whom you love, does indeed look very good on you!

02:37.870 --> 02:38.880
Why?

02:38.880 --> 02:42.300
Why does it always turn out like this?!

02:43.010 --> 02:46.220
Miss, it's a deer.

02:46.220 --> 02:49.180
My, what a cute deer.

02:54.870 --> 02:56.860
It's time for lunch.

02:58.000 --> 03:00.610
I don't feel hungry.

03:00.610 --> 03:02.350
Miss...

03:02.350 --> 03:07.090
I wonder what side of Kanata-kun I've seen up till now?

03:07.090 --> 03:10.780
I thought I knew everything there was to know about Kanata-kun,

03:10.780 --> 03:13.550
yet in reality I don't know a thing.

03:13.550 --> 03:19.550
People believe that it's better if your love is enigmatic.

03:19.550 --> 03:22.000
Miyu-chan knows everything about him.

03:22.000 --> 03:27.650
I too... I too want to know everything about Kanata-kun!

03:27.650 --> 03:29.020
But, Miss-

03:29.300 --> 03:33.440
There's no way you can understand how I feel!

03:39.940 --> 03:44.910
Wanya vs. Shikada-san

03:46.510 --> 03:47.880
Wanya!

03:47.880 --> 03:49.830
Now, what is this?

03:51.030 --> 03:53.350
A big slug!

03:53.350 --> 03:55.960
Sorry, it's an unknown alien.

03:56.390 --> 03:57.130
Then, what is this?

03:57.130 --> 03:58.020
Wanya!

03:58.020 --> 03:59.510
Dango!

03:59.510 --> 04:01.010
Well done.

04:01.010 --> 04:02.160
Then, how about this?

04:02.160 --> 04:03.190
Wanya!

04:03.940 --> 04:06.130
A twisted towel!

04:07.170 --> 04:09.090
Close, but not quite.

04:09.090 --> 04:11.250
It's a freshly wrung rag.

04:11.250 --> 04:12.190
Next.

04:12.190 --> 04:13.390
Wanya!

04:13.390 --> 04:15.010
What about this?

04:15.010 --> 04:17.240
A rice ball!

04:17.240 --> 04:20.170
Correct! And what's inside the rice ball?

04:21.640 --> 04:23.160
Plum!

04:23.160 --> 04:25.820
Wow, Ruu-chama, you're right on the mark!

04:25.820 --> 04:28.180
Wanya, you're amazing.

04:28.180 --> 04:30.530
But what are you going to do if someone sees you?

04:31.500 --> 04:33.110
See? Someone's here.

04:33.110 --> 04:34.790
Wanya, transform.

04:35.360 --> 04:37.250
Coming!

04:37.250 --> 04:38.620
Wanya!

04:38.620 --> 04:39.440
Huh?

04:39.440 --> 04:40.680
Wanya!

04:40.680 --> 04:42.240
What are you doing?!

04:42.240 --> 04:46.590
I might've gotten a bit carried away. I can't seem to transform into my usual human form.

04:46.590 --> 04:47.790
Wanya!

04:49.140 --> 04:51.100
I'm finally back to normal!

04:51.100 --> 04:52.220
Excuse me.

04:54.840 --> 04:59.570
I rang the doorbell, but I heard voices coming from this direction, so...

04:59.850 --> 05:01.640
How long has he been here?

05:01.640 --> 05:05.380
Did he see all of Wanya's transformations?!

05:05.380 --> 05:09.170
What am I going to do?! I can't transform now!

05:10.030 --> 05:13.360
There was no one at the door.

05:13.360 --> 05:14.900
I wonder if someone is playing a prank.

05:14.900 --> 05:15.750
Grrr...

05:16.750 --> 05:22.460
Um... Ah... This is our robot, right?

05:22.460 --> 05:23.980
Yes, that's right!

05:23.980 --> 05:27.910
My mother created this prototype at NASA, right?

05:30.100 --> 05:33.670
Ah, Miss has mentioned this before.

05:33.670 --> 05:36.970
I see, so this is the robot.

05:36.970 --> 05:39.610
I see, it's really well made.

05:39.610 --> 05:43.070
Putting that aside, I came here today to ask you a favor.

05:45.370 --> 05:47.180
A Christmas present?

05:47.180 --> 05:54.450
Yes, the Miss is extremely troubled over what she should give you.

05:54.450 --> 05:58.480
So Chris-chan's already started thinking about such things...

05:58.480 --> 06:05.630
I know very little about such matters, so I came here hoping to get a few ideas.

06:05.630 --> 06:08.240
Kanata, what do you want?

06:08.240 --> 06:10.730
What? It's fine, I don't need any presents.

06:10.730 --> 06:15.130
Why not? She wants to give you one.

06:15.130 --> 06:15.890
It's fine though.

06:16.220 --> 06:18.950
You should accept someone's goodwill without any objections.

06:18.950 --> 06:20.680
Then, Miyu, why don't you accept her present instead?

06:20.680 --> 06:23.230
There's no point in me accepting her present.

06:23.230 --> 06:25.810
But there's no point in me accepting one either...

06:25.810 --> 06:27.170
Excuse me-

06:26.160 --> 06:28.400
Then why don't we get that "Sure-Sleep" pillow?

06:28.400 --> 06:31.850
Recently, I've had a hard time sleeping.

06:31.850 --> 06:35.370
Didn't you say that you wanted a vegetable slicer the other day?

06:35.370 --> 06:38.790
Oh, that. I'm sure Wanya will be delighted to have that.

06:38.790 --> 06:39.790
Excuse me-

06:40.850 --> 06:41.750
Stop!

06:42.210 --> 06:43.710
Go away!

06:47.070 --> 06:49.020
What a persistent crow!

06:49.020 --> 06:50.380
Go away!

06:50.380 --> 06:51.540
Hey!

06:51.540 --> 06:56.350
To think that I have to pretend to be a robot even at a time like this...

07:03.370 --> 07:06.490
You are one impudent crow to steal the dangos!

07:06.490 --> 07:07.740
Give back the dangos!

07:07.740 --> 07:08.970
Give back the dangos!

07:08.970 --> 07:10.060
Give back the dangos!

07:10.060 --> 07:11.150
Give back the dangos!

07:11.150 --> 07:12.580
Give back the dangos!

07:12.580 --> 07:13.760
Give back the dangos!

07:18.870 --> 07:20.640
Wanya! Stop!

07:25.920 --> 07:28.740
Jeez... Kanata, what are you doing?

07:28.740 --> 07:30.590
Please leave this to me.

07:31.370 --> 07:32.550
Shikada-san...

08:04.030 --> 08:06.290
It's all right now.

08:06.290 --> 08:07.930
Thanks, you saved me.

08:07.930 --> 08:09.800
Thank you, Shikada-san.

08:09.800 --> 08:13.780
Just as one would expect from Chris onee-chan's Shikada-san, right?

08:15.040 --> 08:20.220
I would also have been able to save everyone if I didn't have to pretend to be a robot.

08:20.220 --> 08:24.320
Come to think of it, he stole our snack.

08:24.320 --> 08:27.170
Sorry, they were all the dangos we had left.

08:27.170 --> 08:29.190
Please leave it to me.

08:30.370 --> 08:32.490
Sorry, we don't have anything left...

08:33.390 --> 08:35.700
We're going shopping later today which is why...

08:35.700 --> 08:37.320
This is enough.

08:37.320 --> 08:41.520
Kanata's favorite food is squash, so we always have some in the fridge.

08:41.960 --> 08:44.370
So, Saionji-sama loves squashes!

08:44.370 --> 08:45.330
Shikada-san Style

08:44.370 --> 08:45.330
Squash Dessert

08:46.330 --> 08:49.870
I see, so you soften it using the microwave.

08:49.870 --> 08:53.410
Ah, so you slice it into even smaller pieces, boil them, and then mash them.

08:53.410 --> 08:55.510
I see. I see.

08:55.860 --> 08:57.870
Don't get in his way, Miyu.

08:57.870 --> 08:59.810
It's all right.

08:59.810 --> 09:02.020
He said it's okay.

09:02.620 --> 09:08.980
I bought that squash intending to make Kanata-san an amazing squash dish!

09:10.190 --> 09:11.890
Now, please eat up.

09:11.890 --> 09:13.900
Bon appétit!

09:13.900 --> 09:15.990
It looks delicious!

09:19.930 --> 09:21.620
Yummy!

09:21.620 --> 09:24.910
Now, this<i> is what you call "yummy."</i>

09:28.890 --> 09:30.320
Delicious.

09:30.320 --> 09:34.840
We've only been having mitarashi dangos recently, so this really tastes different and fresh!

09:34.840 --> 09:37.820
I apologize for only serving you dangos recently.

09:39.090 --> 09:40.480
Wanya!

09:40.480 --> 09:42.410
A robot that makes tea?

09:42.410 --> 09:44.020
It's a helper robot.

09:44.020 --> 09:47.980
It even understands human languages. It's an excellent robot, isn't it?

09:52.410 --> 09:54.650
Allow me.

10:00.970 --> 10:03.470
I'll do it. I'll do it.

10:04.120 --> 10:07.290
I'm sorry. He's usually an excellent robot, but...

10:07.290 --> 10:10.460
It's fine. I'll make a fresh pot immediately.

10:11.630 --> 10:14.550
I'll do it. I'll do it. I'll do it.

10:14.830 --> 10:17.050
Wanya, go stand over there!

10:20.760 --> 10:24.430
Um, we'll do the rest.

10:24.430 --> 10:26.540
No, please let me.

10:26.540 --> 10:30.720
And pardon me for my rudeness, but it also appears that

10:30.720 --> 10:33.370
the room is rather dirty and you have a pile of laundry to do too.

10:33.370 --> 10:36.400
When I see things in such a state, I can't help but clean up.

10:39.130 --> 10:40.320
He's here again.

10:40.320 --> 10:42.430
I'll do it. I'll do it.

10:49.460 --> 10:50.830
Why, this is splendid!

10:50.830 --> 10:53.920
I can do it when I try. How is that?

11:02.730 --> 11:04.300
That was wonderful!

11:09.650 --> 11:11.120
Shikada-san!

11:11.890 --> 11:13.650
Shikada-san!

11:15.580 --> 11:16.750
Shikada-san?

11:19.220 --> 11:21.530
I wonder where he is...

11:31.100 --> 11:35.420
Shikada-san was worried about me, yet...

11:36.590 --> 11:40.260
There's no way you can understand how I feel!

11:41.020 --> 11:43.890
I said that to him.

11:55.190 --> 11:58.500
I know! I should look for him!

12:00.650 --> 12:05.410
Well then, Ruu, throw me the ball from over there, okay?

12:07.380 --> 12:10.330
Saionji-sama loves stripes.

12:11.100 --> 12:13.310
Excuse me.

12:15.380 --> 12:17.250
He's more of a dog lover than a cat lover.

12:19.710 --> 12:21.720
He's a grade three in Abacus.

12:21.720 --> 12:24.680
He's fairly talented with his fingers.

12:32.550 --> 12:34.650
Oh? He has some aptitude for art.

12:43.280 --> 12:44.240
Watch out!

12:53.000 --> 12:54.640
Amazing!

12:54.640 --> 12:56.550
That was wonderful!

12:57.190 --> 12:58.790
Why, thank you.

12:58.790 --> 13:03.910
You're a genius at cooking, and when you clean, the whole house sparkles.

13:03.910 --> 13:07.190
You can even catch the ball in mid air while somersaulting three times!

13:07.190 --> 13:09.970
Shikada-san, you can do anything!

13:09.970 --> 13:14.980
They're skills I naturally acquired from having to take care of a house for so long.

13:17.080 --> 13:22.400
I've lost my confidence as a sitter-pet.

13:25.360 --> 13:27.030
Shikada-san!

13:27.030 --> 13:28.120
Shikada-san!

13:32.740 --> 13:35.080
Excuse me, Shikada-san?

13:42.530 --> 13:43.800
Shikada-san!

13:44.170 --> 13:45.500
Shikada-san!

13:46.220 --> 13:47.220
What?

13:51.970 --> 13:55.520
Let's play here. We won't break any glass here.

13:56.620 --> 13:59.510
Oh, Momoka-chan, Ruu-kun.

13:59.510 --> 14:01.160
Chris onee-chan.

14:01.160 --> 14:04.150
I don't suppose you've seen Shikada-san, have you?

14:04.150 --> 14:07.910
Oh, if you're looking for Shikada-san, he's at Ruu's house.

14:07.910 --> 14:08.700
What?

14:08.700 --> 14:12.590
Ruu-kun's house is<i> Kanata-kun's house.</i>

14:13.370 --> 14:14.620
I'm going!

14:14.620 --> 14:16.750
Momoka-chan, thank you.

14:17.870 --> 14:21.030
Stop speeding!

14:32.760 --> 14:34.140
Pepo!

14:41.760 --> 14:43.650
This is a free fansub. Not for sale or rent.

14:43.650 --> 14:46.440
Kanata, Ruu-kun and Momoka-chan are missing!

14:46.440 --> 14:47.400
What?

14:47.400 --> 14:51.670
Momoka-chan's with Ruu so I don't think we'll need to worry too much, but...

14:51.670 --> 14:53.370
This is a big problem.

14:53.810 --> 14:58.460
It's my fault. If only I'm not pretending to be a robot...

14:58.460 --> 15:00.910
Anyway, let's look for Ruu-sama.

15:00.910 --> 15:01.630
Yes.

15:02.880 --> 15:04.510
Continue pretending to be a robot, okay?

15:05.080 --> 15:06.710
But what...

15:06.710 --> 15:08.930
You musn't cause a commotion, okay?

15:08.930 --> 15:09.720
Yes...

15:14.730 --> 15:16.670
Excuse me.

15:19.600 --> 15:22.190
Is no one home?

15:22.190 --> 15:23.990
Ruu-kun!

15:23.990 --> 15:25.690
Momoka-chan?

15:26.130 --> 15:28.110
Ruu-sama!

15:30.530 --> 15:32.490
Ruu-chama, where are you?!

15:32.810 --> 15:35.320
Shikada-san?!

15:38.560 --> 15:39.370
Ah!

15:41.710 --> 15:43.470
This is Ruu's ball.

15:43.470 --> 15:44.750
Look.

15:45.540 --> 15:47.710
These are crow feathers.

15:54.230 --> 15:56.600
Wait up!

15:59.260 --> 16:01.560
Miyu-san! Kanata-san!

16:01.560 --> 16:02.950
Wanya.

16:02.950 --> 16:04.450
Have you found Ruu-chama?

16:04.450 --> 16:07.250
We found these lying next to Ruu-kun's ball.

16:07.250 --> 16:10.270
It could've been from the crow from earlier on.

16:10.270 --> 16:12.950
Don't!

16:22.540 --> 16:23.640
Pepo...

16:38.720 --> 16:39.970
[Note: Stinky Can(TM)]

16:43.940 --> 16:45.900
Pepo!

17:10.050 --> 17:12.550
Ruu!

17:12.550 --> 17:13.790
Momoka-chan!

17:13.790 --> 17:15.510
Ruu's...

17:19.470 --> 17:22.820
He can't move because his top's stuck to the branch.

17:22.820 --> 17:24.140
I'll save him.

17:24.140 --> 17:25.480
Ruu-sama!

17:25.860 --> 17:27.230
You can't fly right now.

17:25.860 --> 17:28.650
Momoka-sama!

17:27.230 --> 17:28.650
But Ruu-chama's...

17:28.650 --> 17:29.880
Wanya, you stay here.

17:31.250 --> 17:33.280
Saionji-sama.

17:36.920 --> 17:38.150
Kanata!

17:38.150 --> 17:39.960
The current's strong.

17:43.930 --> 17:45.920
No!

17:45.920 --> 17:47.750
Stop playing!

17:47.750 --> 17:50.190
I'll save Ruu-chama.

17:50.190 --> 17:52.670
Miyu-san, you save the other two.

17:53.570 --> 17:54.840
Wanya?

17:54.840 --> 17:57.630
A flying robot?

18:00.790 --> 18:03.140
Ruu-chama!

18:03.600 --> 18:05.230
Shoo! Shoo!

18:13.810 --> 18:15.790
What a persistent crow.

18:15.790 --> 18:16.710
I remember now!

18:16.710 --> 18:19.320
Shikada-san did something like this...

18:41.140 --> 18:42.900
Wanya!

18:42.900 --> 18:44.560
Ruu-chama!

18:44.560 --> 18:46.520
Hurry up and grab onto this!

18:48.520 --> 18:50.290
This isn't going to work!

18:53.160 --> 18:54.620
Here I go!

19:02.110 --> 19:04.120
It's not reaching them...

19:05.850 --> 19:07.000
Shikada-san!

19:07.280 --> 19:09.210
Please hang in there.

19:09.210 --> 19:13.500
I'm sorry, the costume I'm wearing is so heavy.

19:13.500 --> 19:17.570
Momoka-san, please look after Ruu-chama.

19:17.570 --> 19:18.970
Leave it to me.

19:19.250 --> 19:20.840
This time it'll reach for sure!

19:22.930 --> 19:24.280
Wanya!

19:26.310 --> 19:27.400
Wanya!

19:27.400 --> 19:28.310
Now, hurry.

19:28.310 --> 19:29.580
Okay...

19:46.040 --> 19:48.080
Shikada-san!

19:48.760 --> 19:51.460
Kanata-kun and Shikada-san are both in danger at the same time!

19:53.140 --> 19:54.420
Move!

20:09.490 --> 20:10.990
Shikada-san...

20:10.990 --> 20:12.290
Miss...

20:12.290 --> 20:14.520
I've been looking for you everywhere.

20:14.520 --> 20:16.210
Miss...

20:16.210 --> 20:18.500
I'm sorry for saying something so awful to you.

20:18.500 --> 20:20.490
Please, don't even think of it.

20:20.490 --> 20:24.240
More importantly, for I to have made Miss worry so much...

20:24.240 --> 20:27.890
I clearly still have room for improvement as your personal butler.

20:28.700 --> 20:32.440
That reminds me, Shikada-san, why did you go to Kanata-kun's house?

20:32.440 --> 20:35.270
Oh, don't worry about that.

20:35.270 --> 20:36.030
What?

20:41.100 --> 20:42.500
You're too late.

20:42.500 --> 20:44.390
We can't trick them any more.

20:44.920 --> 20:51.170
I'm greatly moved by your courage to save someone precious.

20:51.170 --> 20:52.320
Shikada-san...

20:53.480 --> 20:59.360
Though you are just a robot, you have very warm hands; it's almost as if you have a heart.

20:59.360 --> 21:05.080
Science has advanced far beyond what I know.

21:05.080 --> 21:08.100
I was able to learn a lot.

21:08.100 --> 21:10.700
Thank you, Wanya-san.

21:11.020 --> 21:15.710
Same to you. Thank you. Thank you.

21:20.250 --> 21:23.790
You two understood each other by only using eye contact just then, didn't you?!

21:23.790 --> 21:25.600
No, we didn't!
No, we didn't!

21:40.420 --> 21:42.580
Shiny....

21:43.340 --> 21:45.820
Shiny...

21:46.110 --> 21:47.550
Wow!

21:48.670 --> 21:51.280
Even the hallway's sparkling.

21:51.280 --> 21:53.670
It's shiny!

21:54.330 --> 21:58.920
Well, Shikada-san is a pro at cooking and cleaning, right?

21:58.920 --> 22:02.670
Indeed, the whole house is shiny.

22:02.670 --> 22:08.810
But you know, having it all nice and shiny isn't always good. It's kind of unsettling.

22:12.220 --> 22:15.770
But everyone seems to be enjoying themselves anyway, right?

22:16.160 --> 22:21.730
It's going to be dirty in no time, so now's our only chance to play.

22:21.730 --> 22:25.190
But, Wanya, you were really cool back then.

22:25.190 --> 22:26.290
Really?

22:28.480 --> 22:32.240
You're a lifesaver. Here, have some dangos.

22:32.240 --> 22:35.370
Oh, no! You're just flattering me now.

22:36.690 --> 22:39.080
You're amazing, Shikada-san.

22:39.540 --> 22:41.090
[Note: The All You Need to Know About Saionji-sama Manual. Beginner Volumes. Book 1.]

22:41.090 --> 22:44.790
With this, I'll know everything there is to know about Kanata-kun.

22:44.790 --> 22:46.630
But how did you compile this?

22:46.630 --> 22:53.010
I just spent the entire day with Saionji-sama and noted things down when necessary.

22:55.200 --> 22:59.980
With this, this year's Christmas is mine!

23:00.260 --> 23:02.980
Shikada-san, thank you.

23:02.980 --> 23:04.270
Miss.

23:09.190 --> 23:11.440
Wanya's diary:

23:11.440 --> 23:15.490
It looks like there are many things I can learn from

23:15.490 --> 23:19.220
Shikada-san's professionalism as a personal butler.

24:29.990 --> 25:00.020
Next Episode

24:31.620 --> 24:33.170
So, the Waru Waru Gang are back?

24:33.170 --> 24:35.780
But it's only one of them and she seems really frail.

24:35.780 --> 24:38.480
Guava-san seems to have been kicked out of the Waru Waru Gang.

24:38.480 --> 24:40.950
What? Then is she going to be staying at Saionji's house for a while?

24:40.950 --> 24:43.260
That's what we thought, but then this happens instead...

24:43.260 --> 24:46.430
Next time on Daa Daa Daa: The Kicked-Out Guava's Love.

24:46.430 --> 24:48.640
Oh my, Guava-chan's in love.

24:48.640 --> 24:50.960
Who? Who is it?

24:50.960 --> 24:52.670
Please tell me!

24:54.970 --> 25:00.020
The Kicked-Out Guava's Love

24:54.970 --> 24:56.500
I don't understand...
